<Layout title="Track Record — Apoorva Mehta, MD, MBA">
	<h1>Track Record</h1>
	<p>
		Three ventures, each one started before I'd finished training —
		because I wanted to see healthcare built differently, not just
		delivered.
	</p>
	<p>
		I co-founded <strong>ChartR</strong>, a company building long-horizon
		reinforcement learning environments for clinical AI, alongside
		automating front- and back-office workflows in enterprise healthcare.
		It's no longer active.
	</p>
	<p>
		Before that, as a fellow at <strong>Rock Health Capital</strong>, I
		evaluated thousands of early-stage digital health startups —
		commercial, technical, and clinical diligence — with end-to-end
		involvement on investments including Vitalize and HealthMC.
	</p>
	<p>
		And earlier, at <strong>SkinCheck</strong>, I helped grow a digital
		dermatology platform to 100,000+ downloads and 6,500 monthly active
		users, shaped its health-plan partnership strategy, and helped raise
		its pre-seed round.
	</p>
</Layout>
